adjudication.rationale:
In BackwardsCompatibilityUserStorageTest, the helper method setupRecoveryKeysForUserWithRequiredAction(String userId, boolean logoutOtherSessions) contains a conditional branch:

```java
if (!logoutOtherSessions) {
    setupRecoveryAuthnCodesPage.uncheckLogoutSessions();
}
```

But within this diff, the only invocation is:

```java
List<String> recoveryKeys = setupRecoveryKeysForUserWithRequiredAction(userId, true);
```

No call site passes `false`, so the `uncheckLogoutSessions()` path is currently dead/uncovered by tests. This is a concrete test coverage issue introduced/exposed by this change, not a product defect.
